#. Description of the plugin
#: babilim.php
msgid "Fills in missing translations for the plugins and themes already installed on your site."
msgstr "ເຕີມການແປທີ່ຂາດຫາຍສຳລັບປລັກອິນ ແລະ ທີມທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນເວັບໄຊຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:335
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:336
#: admin/class-babilim-translations-table.php:400
