#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3305
msgid "Install available translations automatically"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງການແປທີ່ມີໃຫ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3306
msgid "On the free plan, only components that already use one of your free slots are installed automatically, so no new slot is taken."
msgstr "ໃນແຜນຟຣີ, ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດສະເພາະອົງປະກອບທີ່ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງວ່າງຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ຊ່ອງໃໝ່."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3307
msgid "This site is part of a multisite network, which does not install new translations automatically. Translations that are already installed are still updated."
msgstr "ເວັບໄຊນີ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ multisite ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ຕິດຕັ້ງການແປໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ແຕ່ການແປທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວຍັງຄົງຖືກອັບເດດຢູ່."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3310
msgid "Custom overrides"
msgstr "ການແທນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3312
msgid "Keep my own translation overrides when purging everything or uninstalling this plugin."
